----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Other
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Some skills carry an "alignments" field. Each entry holds a source id naming a
university course list or catalogue (for example "mit-subject-catalogue"), a
status, a framework id and a short topic area slug such as "abstract-algebra".
It carries no text from those sources: only these identifiers, written by this
project. The framework id refers to a framework file that is not part of this
repository. The institutions are not affiliated with this project.

Runtime dependencies are installed separately and keep their own licences:
SymPy (BSD-3-Clause), NumPy (BSD-3-Clause), mpmath (BSD-3-Clause), PyYAML
(MIT).
